/T (Personalized Learning: Generates quizzes for almost any subject based on the user's immediate needs. Time Efficient: Removes the need to manually search for or prepare questions. Interactive Assessment: Provides a focused quiz experience with progress tracking. Instant Feedback: Gives scores, correct answers, and short explanations immediately. Scalable Solution: Can be extended with user accounts, saved quizzes, analytics, and multiple AI models. Accessible Learning: A web-based interface can be used from any device with internet access.)
